    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delivery Depot is a single-player, time-based parcel delivery game. You must collect, transport and deliver parcels before you run out of time and the parcel disappears forever. Drive fast and try not to crash your vehicle while navigating the busy roads!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587720/extras/43f9143734ba884b83d076f5c7f43fa0.poster.avif?t=1743163662\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587720/extras/43f9143734ba884b83d076f5c7f43fa0.webm?t=1743163662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587720/extras/43f9143734ba884b83d076f5c7f43fa0.mp4?t=1743163662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three different levels.\u00a0\u00a0</strong>Levels are different sizes to ensure that each level gets progressively more challenging. Level sizes are: small, medium, and large.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six characters.</strong>\u00a0You can choose from six characters: bear, cow, dog, elephant, giraffe, koala.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three vehicles.\u00a0</strong>Choose from three vehicles: car, van, and truck. Each vehicle has different properties that can assist you while delivering parcels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game progression.</strong>\u00a0Characters and vehicles can be bought in the shop, levels can also be bought in the level selection screen, <u>all of which can be purchased with parcels that you deliver.</u></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delivery Depot is a single-player, time-based parcel delivery game. You must collect, transport and deliver parcels before you run out of time and the parcel disappears forever. Drive fast and try not to crash your vehicle while navigating the busy roads!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587720/extras/43f9143734ba884b83d076f5c7f43fa0.poster.avif?t=1743163662\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587720/extras/43f9143734ba884b83d076f5c7f43fa0.webm?t=1743163662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587720/extras/43f9143734ba884b83d076f5c7f43fa0.mp4?t=1743163662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three different levels.\u00a0\u00a0</strong>Levels are different sizes to ensure that each level gets progressively more challenging. Level sizes are: small, medium, and large.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six characters.</strong>\u00a0You can choose from six characters: bear, cow, dog, elephant, giraffe, koala.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three vehicles.\u00a0</strong>Choose from three vehicles: car, van, and truck. Each vehicle has different properties that can assist you while delivering parcels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game progression.</strong>\u00a0Characters and vehicles can be bought in the shop, levels can also be bought in the level selection screen, <u>all of which can be purchased with parcels that you deliver.</u></p></li></ul>",
